    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"PatientDocuments-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p>This feature is used to receive and capture patient's information in the form of documents (patient's paper record scans, X-Ray images and other external documents). Bahmni allows you to upload these documents and associating it to specific visits of a patient. All these documents get attached to a patient's record and are viewable from the Visit dashboard.</p><h2 id=\"PatientDocuments-Steps\">Steps</h2><h3 id=\"PatientDocuments-1.GotoPatientDocuments\">1. Go to Patient Documents</h3><p>Click on Patient Documents on the Bahmni Home Page</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" alt=\"Home Dashboard\" width=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/Home%20Dashboard.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492061974938&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=373\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014370/Home%20Dashboard.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492061974938&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"116102378\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Home Dashboard.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014370\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"aff374f4-41b2-4df1-b6ea-50e7b0725644\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Home Dashboard\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/Home%20Dashboard.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492061974938&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=746 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/Home%20Dashboard.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492061974938&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=373 1x\"></span></p><h3 id=\"PatientDocuments-2.SelectaPatient\">2. Select a Patient </h3><p>Select or Search for a Patient.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/image2017-4-13_11-20-29.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492062634282&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=715&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014370/image2017-4-13_11-20-29.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492062634282&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"116102566\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-4-13_11-20-29.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014370\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"d75fec47-bd75-4b13-86db-217ce82e9680\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/image2017-4-13_11-20-29.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492062634282&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1430&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/image2017-4-13_11-20-29.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492062634282&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=715&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></p><h3 id=\"PatientDocuments-3.Uploadoneormoredocuments\">3. Upload one or more documents</h3><ul><li>Upload one or more documents by clicking the &quot;+&quot; sign</li><li>Select a value to identify the document<ul><li>For versions 0.90 or earlier, you have to specify a valid type. e.g. &quot;Patient file&quot; </li><li>From version 0.91 onwards, the text box has been replaced with a dropdown. This dropdown contains members of concept &quot;Patient Documents&quot;. Add the appropriate member concepts as per your implementation needs.</li><li>Regarding configuration of Patient Document types, see <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014592/Patient+Documents+Module#PatientDocumentsModule-ConfiguringPatientDocumentTypes\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a></li></ul></li><li>Click Save</li></ul><p><br/></p><p><strong><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" alt=\"0.90 and earlier\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/Capturing%20Patient%20Documents.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492062003852&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=243\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014370/Capturing%20Patient%20Documents.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492062003852&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"116102396\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Capturing Patient Documents.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014370\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"dbadeec8-37c8-4a1e-a3a0-bf3d857fceac\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"0.90 and earlier\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/Capturing%20Patient%20Documents.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492062003852&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=486 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/Capturing%20Patient%20Documents.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492062003852&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=243 1x\"></span></strong></p><p><br/></p><p>               <span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" alt=\"0.91 and above\" height=\"315\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/image2018-8-1_11-26-20.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1533102984401&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=315\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014370/image2018-8-1_11-26-20.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1533102984401&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"699531268\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2018-8-1_11-26-20.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014370\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"ae342dbb-8e55-4583-ba48-bdec00073e2a\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"0.91 and above\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/image2018-8-1_11-26-20.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1533102984401&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=952&amp;height=429 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/image2018-8-1_11-26-20.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1533102984401&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=315 1x\"></span></p><h3 id=\"PatientDocuments-4.Viewuploadeddocuments\"><span>4. View uploaded documents</span></h3><p><span>To see uploaded documents against a patient, one can go to Clinical → Dashboard → Visit Control → Visit Dashboard → Patient Files. </span></p><p><span>Or you can easily see it on the Sidebar in the Clinical app (when you click on the top right burger icon)</span></p><p><span><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/Patient%20Documents%20Sidebar.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492062214058&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=213\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014370/Patient%20Documents%20Sidebar.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492062214058&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"116102456\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Patient Documents Sidebar.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014370\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"542e41f0-75a9-45ab-8dae-d85b3f5d9c67\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/Patient%20Documents%20Sidebar.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492062214058&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=426 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014370/Patient%20Documents%20Sidebar.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1492062214058&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=213 1x\"></span></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e4e357ee-8b8f-40f4-8c33-40938be496b2\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"f72ed4fe-8cff-4f86-8511-87b28ccc6e11\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div> <p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32604209/Patient+Document+Management\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32604209\" data-linked-resource-version=\"14\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Patient Documents - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"55de8170-c071-4602-aacf-72d73bdf438e\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Implementation Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014592/Patient+Documents+Module\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014592\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Patient Documents - Implementer's Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
